{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55558","headline":"颂 · 义昭","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎头生角人难措，石火电光须密布。\n假饶烈士也应难，懵底那能解差（《五灯会元》作「回」）互。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十三、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}